{"id":"conv_04889","context":"A retired exec mentors a younger boss about corporate strategy","ambient":"cafe_quiet_chatter","cast":["hiroshi_elder","hiroshi_boss"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"To put it bluntly, I think the cause of your company's poor performance lies not in strategy, but in your employee training curriculum.","jp":"端的に言うとね、君の会社の業績低迷の原因は、戦略じゃなくて社員研修のカリキュラムにあると思うよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,9,13,22,51,57,68,99,132,157,175,182,789,1077,1465,1723,3867,8036,8273,8274,8281,11631],"jpTokens":[{"s":"端的","r":"たんてき","w":8273},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"言う","r":"いう","w":157},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"、"},{"s":"君","r":"きみ","w":175},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"会社","r":"かいしゃ","w":182},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"業績","r":"ぎょうせき","w":3867},{"s":"低迷","r":"ていめい","w":8281},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"原因","r":"げんいん","w":789},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"戦略","r":"せんりゃく","w":1077},{"s":"じゃ","w":132},{"s":"なく","w":13},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"社員","r":"しゃいん","w":1465},{"s":"研修","r":"けんしゅう","w":1723},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"カリキュラム","w":8274},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"ある","w":22},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"思う","r":"おもう","w":99},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"The curriculum, you say. Honestly, I had never thought about it that deeply.","jp":"カリキュラム、ですか。正直、そこまで深く考えたことはありませんでした。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,8,14,15,16,17,22,26,39,52,54,117,220,318,1578,1803,2027,4781,5964,8036,8274,8785,9114,9856,11631,12599,13365],"jpTokens":[{"s":"カリキュラム","w":8274},{"s":"、"},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"},{"s":"正直","r":"しょうじき","w":1578},{"s":"、"},{"s":"そこ","w":220},{"s":"まで","w":52},{"s":"深く","r":"ふかく","w":1803},{"s":"考え","r":"かんがえ","w":318},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"あり","w":22},{"s":"ませ","w":14},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"でし","w":17},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Even if you only focus on exploring new markets, it means nothing if there's no vitality on the ground.","jp":"新しい市場の探索ばかりに目を向けても、現場に活力がなければ意味がないんだ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,5,6,11,13,21,26,41,136,158,177,339,406,498,1039,2861,3602,6641,7965,8258,8259,11494,11740],"jpTokens":[{"s":"新しい","r":"あたらしい","w":339},{"s":"市場","r":"しじょう","w":498},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"探索","r":"たんさく","w":8258},{"s":"ばかり","w":406},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"目","r":"め","w":136},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"向け","r":"むけ","w":7965},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"、"},{"s":"現場","r":"げんば","w":1039},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"活力","r":"かつりょく","w":8259},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"なけれ","w":13},{"s":"ば","w":41},{"s":"意味","r":"いみ","w":177},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"Indeed, lately we've only gathered so-called aces, and I feel we're not raising people who truly deserve praise.","jp":"確かに、最近うちには自称エースばかり集まって、本当に賞賛に値する人材が育っていない気がします。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,3,4,6,13,14,18,19,150,223,268,289,406,488,2056,2234,3298,3602,3623,4285,4813,6641,7885,8253,8268,8432,8984,10069,12469],"jpTokens":[{"s":"確か","r":"たしか","w":488},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"、"},{"s":"最近","r":"さいきん","w":223},{"s":"うち","w":268},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"自称","r":"じしょう","w":8268},{"s":"エース","w":8432},{"s":"ばかり","w":406},{"s":"集まっ","r":"あつまっ","w":4813},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"本当に","r":"ほんとうに","w":289},{"s":"賞賛","r":"しょうさん","w":10069},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"値する","r":"あたいする","w":8253},{"s":"人材","r":"じんざい","w":2056},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"育っ","r":"そだっ","w":8984},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"気","r":"き","w":150},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"That's it. You can keep doing layoffs under the name of reform, but the organization will never build real strength.","jp":"それだ。改革と称してリストラを繰り返しても、組織の地力はつかんよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4